{"availability":"available","full":"itsLucas02/clinizaro","name":"clinizaro","description":"Clinic CRM for Klinik Seri Ayu — leads, WhatsApp inbox, doctor scheduling, walk-in queue, device sessions and an AI receptionist. Next.js 16, Drizzle, Postgres with a zero-config PGlite demo mode.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-20T20:08:10Z","updated":"2026-09-20T20:30:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://clinizaro-phi.vercel.app","topics":["clinic-management","crm","demo-app","drizzle-orm","healthcare","nextjs","pglite","postgres","postgresql","react","react-server-components","server-actions","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel-deployment","whatsapp"],"demo":"https://clinizaro-phi.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:59.087Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:59.087Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:59.087Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:59.087Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A clinic CRM for Klinik Seri Ayu — patient leads, a WhatsApp inbox, doctor scheduling, a walk-in queue, device sessions and an AI receptionist, in one ledger-styled workspace.","Clinizaro is a front-office CRM for a multi-doctor clinic. It follows a single patient from the first enquiry through to a completed treatment — capturing the lead, answering them on WhatsApp, booking the slot, calling their queue number, and scheduling the recall.","The interface is deliberately styled as a clinic ledger: paper stock, ruled lines, tabular figures, rubber date stamps and a serif/sans pairing, so it reads like the front-desk book the staff already know."],"features":["Pipeline across baru → dihubungi → layak → ditempah → rawatan → selesai plus hilang","Engagement temperature (panas / suam / sejuk), source attribution and owner assignment","Filter by stage, source, engagement or owner, with free-text search ov